      "summaries": {
        "en": "Cypress is a front-end testing framework that makes end-to-end, component, and integration testing fast and reliable. Unlike Selenium, it runs directly in the browser using a unique architecture that enables real-time reloads, automatic waiting, and time-travel debugging. Developers can write tests in JavaScript/TypeScript with a simple API, and use its interactive runner to debug flaky tests. Ideal for modern web apps built with React, Angular, or Vue, Cypress simplifies CI integration and provides network stubbing, screenshot capture, and video recording out of the box.",
        "zh": "Cypress 是一款专为浏览器应用设计的前端测试框架，采用独特架构直接在浏览器中运行测试，解决传统工具（如 Selenium）速度慢、调试难的问题。它支持自动等待、实时重载和时间旅行调试，开发者可用 JavaScript 或 TypeScript 编写组件测试、端到端测试及 API 拦截。内置截图、视频录制和 CI 集成功能，特别适合 React、Angular 或 Vue 项目，能快速验证用户流程，通过自定义命令扩展测试逻辑，显著提升测试可靠性与开发效率。",
        "es": "Cypress is a front-end testing framework that makes end-to-end, component, and integration testing fast and reliable. Unlike Selenium, it runs directly in the browser using a unique architecture that enables real-time reloads, automatic waiting, and time-travel debugging. Developers can write tests in JavaScript/TypeScript with a simple API, and use its interactive runner to debug flaky tests. Ideal for modern web apps built with React, Angular, or Vue, Cypress simplifies CI integration and provides network stubbing, screenshot capture, and video recording out of the box.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "cypress stands out for angular-testing-library, component-testing, and cypress in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Cypress is a front-end testing framework that makes end-to-end, component, and integration testing fast and reliable. Unlike Selenium, it runs directly in the browser using a unique architecture that enables real-time reloads, automatic waiting, and time-travel debugging. Developers can write tests in JavaScript/TypeScript with a simple API, and use its interactive runner to debug flaky tests. Ideal for modern web apps built with React, Angular, or Vue, Cypress simplifies CI integration and provides network stubbing, screenshot capture, and video recording out of the box.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/cypress-io/cypress for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
