      "summaries": {
        "en": "Clone-Wars is a curated collection of 100+ open-source clones of popular websites and apps like Airbnb, Instagram, and Netflix. It helps developers learn how to build full-stack applications by studying real-world codebases. Each clone includes source code, demo links, and tech stack details. You can explore different architectures, compare implementations, or use a clone as a starter template for your own project. It's a practical resource for honing your skills through reverse engineering.",
        "zh": "Clone-Wars 是一个精心整理的集合，收录了 100 多个流行网站和应用的克隆版，如 Airbnb、Instagram、Netflix 等。它帮助开发者通过研究真实项目的代码来学习全栈开发。每个克隆项目都附有源代码、演示链接和技术栈详情。你可以探索不同的架构设计，对比实现方式，或者直接拿一个克隆作为自己项目的起点。对于想通过逆向工程提升编程技能的人来说，这是一个非常实用的资源。",
        "es": "Clone-Wars is a curated collection of 100+ open-source clones of popular websites and apps like Airbnb, Instagram, and Netflix. It helps developers learn how to build full-stack applications by studying real-world codebases. Each clone includes source code, demo links, and tech stack details. You can explore different architectures, compare implementations, or use a clone as a starter template for your own project. It's a practical resource for honing your skills through reverse engineering.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "Clone-Wars stands out for airbnb, clone, and instagram in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Clone-Wars is a curated collection of 100+ open-source clones of popular websites and apps like Airbnb, Instagram, and Netflix. It helps developers learn how to build full-stack applications by studying real-world codebases. Each clone includes source code, demo links, and tech stack details. You can explore different architectures, compare implementations, or use a clone as a starter template for your own project. It's a practical resource for honing your skills through reverse engineering.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/GorvGoyl/Clone-Wars for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
