      "summaries": {
        "en": "pytest is a mature Python testing framework that simplifies writing simple tests while scaling to complex functional testing. Its key innovation is plain assert statements instead of self.assertEqual, plus automatic test discovery and powerful fixtures for dependency injection. Use it to write clean, maintainable tests for any Python project, from small scripts to large applications, with plugins for coverage, parallelism, and more.",
        "zh": "pytest 是一款成熟的 Python 测试框架，核心设计亮点包括：使用普通 assert 语句替代繁琐的 self.assertEqual，自动发现测试文件与函数，大幅降低入门门槛；通过 fixture 机制实现依赖注入，优雅管理数据库连接、临时文件等测试资源；拥有丰富插件生态，支持并行执行、代码覆盖率、参数化测试等功能。无论是小型脚本还是大型项目，pytest 都能帮助编写简洁、可维护的测试，并支持从 unittest 迁移。",
        "es": "pytest is a mature Python testing framework that simplifies writing simple tests while scaling to complex functional testing. Its key innovation is plain assert statements instead of self.assertEqual, plus automatic test discovery and powerful fixtures for dependency injection. Use it to write clean, maintainable tests for any Python project, from small scripts to large applications, with plugins for coverage, parallelism, and more.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "pytest stands out for hacktoberfest, python, and test in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "pytest is a mature Python testing framework that simplifies writing simple tests while scaling to complex functional testing. Its key innovation is plain assert statements instead of self.assertEqual, plus automatic test discovery and powerful fixtures for dependency injection. Use it to write clean, maintainable tests for any Python project, from small scripts to large applications, with plugins for coverage, parallelism, and more.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/pytest-dev/pytest for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
