        "zh": "Meshery 是一个云原生管理器，旨在简化 Kubernetes 及云原生基础设施的采用与运维。它作为可视化控制平面，提供协作界面来设计、管理和观测环境。其技术亮点在于支持 GitOps 工作流、基础设施即代码，并集成超过 200 个提供商。你可以用它部署和管理微服务，应用最佳实践，实时可视化服务网格。无论是团队协作还是个人实验，Meshery 都能帮助你更高效地驾驭云原生生态。",
        "es": "Meshery is a cloud native manager that simplifies the adoption and operation of Kubernetes and cloud native infrastructure. It acts as a visual control plane, enabling users to design, manage, and observe their environments through a collaborative interface. Technically, it supports GitOps workflows, infrastructure-as-code, and integrates with over 200 providers. You can use it to deploy and manage microservices, apply best practices, and visualize service meshes in real-time.",
        "sections": {
